---
import AboutHeroImage from '../assets/midjourney21.png';
import WhuImage from '../assets/whu.png';
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About Me"
	titleZh="关于我"
	description="Life is a continuous journey of discovery"
	descriptionZh="关于这个网站和作者的简短说明。"
	pubDate={new Date('August 08 2021')}
>

	<p>
My story begins in a remote Hunan village, which made the local dialect my very first language. A childhood move to a Cantonese-speaking area immersed me in a world of languages, where I learned Mandarin, Cantonese, and English all at once.
</p>
<p>
My love for exploration led me to board a high-speed train, traveling a thousand kilometers to <span class="campus-hover">a beautiful campus<img class="campus-tooltip" src={WhuImage.src} alt="Wuhan University campus" /></span> for my bachelor's degree, and later across the sea to Taiwan for an unforgettable exchange semester.
	</p>

	<p>
Life is a continuous journey of discovery. 
</p>
<p>
Two years later, I crossed oceans alone to explore Australia. What started as a new adventure turned into a permanent home when my work as a software engineer led to my permanent residency, and eventually, Australian citizenship.
</p>
<p>
Much like my love for spoken languages, I am a passionate polyglot in the tech world, finding joy in crafting modern, scalable applications. I've been writing code since 2015, spending the past few years helping businesses in Banking, FinTech, Retail, and Education bring high-performing digital solutions to life. On top of that, my Master of Information Technology at UNSW, a top tier university here — has given me some really challenging and high-quality training.
</p>
<p>
Beyond the screen, I mentor junior programmers, stay active with Parkrun, and feed my curiosity through reading, history, road trips, swimming, and tasting cuisines from every corner of the globe.
	</p>


	<p>
	*Quokkas are famous online as the world's happiest animals and they are basically symbols of positivity. I built this theme and named it after them just to capture that vibe, and to say a little thank you for the joy these Western Australian animals bring to people.
	</p>

<img src={AboutHeroImage.src}/>

	<p>
	*Images featured on this site are sourced from Midjourney's community showcase
	</p>
</Layout>

<style>
	.campus-hover {
		position: relative;
		display: inline-block;
		color: rgb(var(--accent));
		cursor: pointer;
		text-decoration: underline;
		text-underline-offset: 3px;
	}

	.campus-tooltip {
		position: absolute;
		bottom: calc(100% + 10px);
		left: 50%;
		transform: translateX(-50%);
		width: 540px;
		height: auto;
		border-radius: 8px;
		box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.18);
		opacity: 0;
		visibility: hidden;
		transition: opacity 0.25s ease, visibility 0.25s ease;
		pointer-events: none;
		z-index: 999;
	}

	.campus-hover:hover .campus-tooltip {
		opacity: 1;
		visibility: visible;
	}
</style>
